          {
            "beginsOn": "2026-11-11T18:00:00Z",
            "category": "MEETING",
            "contacts": [],
            "description": "<p>Join us for a welcoming space where math lovers come together to study independently, side by side. Whether you are working through a textbook, researching a new concept, or progressing a personal project, this is a time and space to allow you to prioritize your learning of the mathematics that&#39;s currently interesting you.</p><p>We gather twice a month on weekday evenings to work in parallel. We are each on our own path but let&#39;s help each other to continue our studies and learning.</p><p>Whether you are a seasoned mathematician or simply mathematically minded, you are welcome here. Bring your books or notes and your curiosity.</p><p>We look forward to learning alongside you!</p>",
